# Who reviews what. GitHub requests a review from the owners of every path a
# pull request changes; with "Require review from Code Owners" on, their
# approval is needed to merge. The last matching pattern wins.

*                       @proob-ai

# The verified core and the trusted base it rests on: a change here can
# change what Holds means.
/crates/proob-core/     @proob-ai
/crates/proob-trusted/  @proob-ai

# proob's own declaration and the workflows that gate and evidence it.
/proob/                 @proob-ai
/.github/workflows/     @proob-ai
/action.yml             @proob-ai
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @proob-ai
